and with legs apart and ball in the air. If a team mate dribbles their ball through your legs you are unfrozen and rejoin the game!","focus":"Dribbling","video":"https://youtu.be/89PdzbwKCVg?si=vgAYaqlB-0ao4sca","easy":"Reduce the playing area to to encourage more frequent stops and starts.","expert":"The Tagger must also dribble a ball while trying to freeze the other players.","coachCues":"Stay low like a Hero! Use your low dribble superpower to change directions."}},{"id":"a6","segment":"Skills 3","name":"Numbers Game","time":"5m","drill":{"summary":"Assign each player a number. When their number is called, they run out, receive a pass, and play 1v1 to the basket.","focus":"Dribbling, Shooting, Defence","easy":"Call numbers one at a time.","expert":"Call multiple numbers for 2v2 or 3v3.","coachCues":"Listen closely! Attack the basket quickly!"}},{"id":"a99","segment":"Wrap up","name":"REFLECTION & REWARDS","time":"4m"}]}');
